      "area": "General",
      "position": 15,
      "content": "Notes: 1) A minimum of 16 units must be completed at Pacific. 2) Students who complete CORE 002 do not need to take ENGL 025 3) Either ENGL 106 or ENGL 109 can be counted as a “Creative and Professional Writing, Editing, and Publishing” elective if it is NOT already being counted to fulfill one of the “Required Courses.” 4) “Experiential Learning and Individualized Study” electives are optional, not required for the major. 5) Complete at least one elective from each of the sections 3D, 3E,3F, and 3G. The remaining two electives can be completed from any of those four categories or from the Experiential Learning &amp; Individualized Study category i.e. Section 3H. 6) At least three electives must be upper division courses, numbered 100 or above.",
      "contentHtml": "<p><strong style=\"font-size: 16px;\"><em>Notes:</em></strong><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\">&nbsp;</span></p><p><strong style=\"font-size: 16px;\"><em>1)</em></strong><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\">&nbsp;A minimum of 16 units must be completed at Pacific.&nbsp;</span></p><p><strong style=\"font-size: 16px;\"><em>2)</em></strong><em style=\"font-size: 16px;\">&nbsp;</em><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\">Students who complete&nbsp;</span><a href=\"https://catalog.pacific.edu/search/?P=CORE%20002\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\" style=\"font-size: 16px;\">CORE&nbsp;002</a><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\">&nbsp;do not need to take&nbsp;</span><a href=\"https://catalog.pacific.edu/search/?P=ENGL%20025\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\" style=\"font-size: 16px;\">ENGL&nbsp;025</a><strong style=\"font-size: 16px;\">&nbsp;</strong></p><p><strong style=\"font-size: 16px;\"><em>3)</em></strong><em style=\"font-size: 16px;\">&nbsp;</em><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\">Either&nbsp;</span><a href=\"https://catalog.pacific.edu/search/?P=ENGL%20106\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\" style=\"font-size: 16px;\">ENGL&nbsp;106</a><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\">&nbsp;or&nbsp;</span><a href=\"https://catalog.pacific.edu/search/?P=ENGL%20109\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\" style=\"font-size: 16px;\">ENGL&nbsp;109</a><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\">&nbsp;can be counted as a “Creative and Professional Writing, Editing, and Publishing” elective if it is NOT already being counted to fulfill one of the “Required Courses.”&nbsp;</span></p><p><strong style=\"font-size: 16px;\"><em>4)</em></strong><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\">&nbsp;“Experiential Learning and Individualized Study” electives are optional, not required for the major. </span></p><p><strong style=\"font-size: 16px;\"><em>5)</em></strong><em style=\"font-size: 16px;\">&nbsp;</em><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\">Complete at least one elective from each of the sections 3D, 3E,3F, and 3G. The remaining two electives can be completed from any of those four categories or from the Experiential Learning &amp; Individualized Study category i.e. Section 3H. </span></p><p><strong style=\"font-size: 16px;\"><em>6)</em></strong><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\">At least three electives must be upper division courses, numbered 100 or above.</span></p>"
