        "links": []
      },
      {
        "text": "In order to earn the Bachelor of Arts degree with a major in English and Writing Professions, students must complete a minimum of 120 units with a Pacific cumulative and major/program grade point average of 2.0.",
        "links": []
      },
      {
        "text": "General Education Requirements",
        "links": []
      },
      {
        "text": "For more details, see General Education\nMinimum 28 units and 9 courses that include:",
